    "sections": {
        "description": "STTravel is a modern, responsive, and easy-to-use WordPress theme designed for travel agencies, tour operators, travel bloggers, vacation planners, and tourism websites. It provides a clean and engaging layout to showcase destinations, tour packages, travel experiences, services, and helpful travel content. Built with a focus on simplicity and flexibility, STTravel helps you create a professional travel website without requiring advanced technical knowledge. Its responsive design ensures your website looks great on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Whether you are promoting tour packages, showcasing destinations, sharing travel stories, or building a complete travel agency website, STTravel provides a solid and flexible foundation for your next WordPress project."
    },
